          "note": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Test: prepend \"If applied, this commit will ___\". The result must be a grammatical English sentence.",
          "source": "https://llms-explorer.com/sources/mdb-context-hub/commit-message-craft/#2-imperative-mood-for-the-subject",
